Sat Oct 24 18:14:57 CEST 2026 - Marcus Schäfer <marcus.schaefer@gmail.com>

- Add new command flake-ctl firecracker build

  The new flake-ctl firecracker build command allows to
  build firecracker images from a given KIWI image
  description. The build command itself only requires
  podman on the host. The build command starts an instance
  of a flakes.yml configured kiwi container image and
  runs a kiwi boxbuild command inside of it. The provided
  kiwi image description must be suitable to build
  a firecracker compatible image. In terms of kiwi this
  is the KIS image type. Examples of such image descriptions
  are provided with the flake-pilot git repository below
  the appstore/firecracker directory and can be used
  as examples for other images.

