Wed Oct 21 12:20:48 CEST 2026 - Marcus Schäfer <marcus.schaefer@gmail.com>

- Differentiate stderr and stdout channels

  firecracker-pilot now keeps the command's stdout and stderr on
  separate channels whenever its own stdout and stderr aren't both
  terminals, for example app > out.txt or app 2>err.log. sci tries
  to connect to that ports before it starts the command.
  This Fixes #177

