Wed Oct 14 10:37:19 CEST 2026 - Marcus Schäfer <marcus.schaefer@gmail.com>

- Add locking to the firecracker network state file

  Concurrent firecracker network add/remove calls can lose
  updates. Calls that change the network state now take an
  exclusive flock and hold it for the whole command, so two
  concurrent calls can no longer lose each other's changes
  or hand out the same address twice.

