Tue Oct 13 12:18:32 CEST 2026 - Marcus Schäfer <marcus.schaefer@gmail.com>

- Fix bubblewrap documentation and code comments

  The bubblewrap pilot intentionally keeps the written
  data from the overlayfs on the system to be able to
  re-use this information on the next call of the app.
  If there is a need for keeping the sandbox data isolated
  and not exposed or kept on the host we will come up
  with the respective code on demand

