Tue Oct 13 12:01:04 CEST 2026 - Marcus Schäfer <marcus.schaefer@gmail.com>

- Drop sci injection

  When pulling a firecracker image, the code checked if the
  sci binary was part of the rootfs and injected it if it
  wasn't. This code is now dropped because mostly unused
  and it also breaks the checksum validation of the pulled
  image. It is also considered security critical to modify
  the rootfs after pull and it drops the eventually needed
  root permissions from the pull command.

