Thu Sep 17 20:54:36 CEST 2026 - Marcus Schäfer <marcus.schaefer@gmail.com>

- Add new pilot named bubblewrap-pilot

  The bubblewrap-pilot is a sandbox pilot based on the
  bubblewrap (bwrap) tool. It calls the registered command
  in a given tree, typically a root filesystem tree. In
  addition to the pilot the respective flake-ctl bubblewrap
  register/show/remove commands were implemented and
  documented. Also add new command "flake-ctl podman export"
  which allows to export a given container into a directory
  tree. This exported tree can then be used for example
  in a bubblewrap registration serving as overlay-src
  data tree.

