-------------------------------------------------------------------
Thu Sep 03 22:50:42 CEST 2026 - Marcus Schäfer <marcus.schaefer@gmail.com>

- Add handler for terminal resize over vsock

  In a firecracker guest/host connection via vsock, the
  initial terminal size of the caller is transfered as
  boot arguments. If the terminal size changes during
  runtime this information was not passed to the pty in
  the guest and all applications still assumed the original
  terminal size leading to rendering issues. This commit
  adds a vsock connection on port 53 to transfer terminal
  size information as they appear and sci applies them
  to the pty in the guest. This Fixes #116

